          example: { label: '添加到 read_docs.py 末尾', text: 'def search(keyword, paragraphs):\n    hits = []\n    for number, paragraph in enumerate(paragraphs, start=1):\n        if keyword and keyword in paragraph:\n            hits.append({"paragraph": number, "text": paragraph})\n    return hits\n\nkeyword = input("搜索词：").strip()\nprint(search(keyword, paragraphs))' },
